        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011091-e2722d8e39567687",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011091",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We rely on contract manufacturers to produce our Products and product candidates.",
        "start_character": 32487,
        "end_character": 32568
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011091",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011091-e2722d8e39567687",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011091",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell Korlym and a generic version of Korlym in the United States (our “Products”) using sales representatives to call on physicians caring for patients with hypercortisolism.",
        "start_character": 4432,
        "end_character": 4609
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011091",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011091-e2722d8e39567687",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011091",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Benefits of orphan drug designation by the EC are similar but include protocol assistance from the European Medicines Agency (“EMA”), access to the centralized marketing authorization procedure in the European Union (“EU”) and, if we obtain approval, ten years of exclusive marketing rights in the EU for the treatment of patients with hypercortisolism.",
        "start_character": 17404,
        "end_character": 17757
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011091",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011091-e2722d8e39567687",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011091",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "If we pursue marketing approval for an indication broader than the orphan drug designation we have received, we may not be entitled to orphan drug exclusivity for the broader indication.",
